(globalThis.TURBOPACK||(globalThis.TURBOPACK=[])).push(["object"==typeof document?document.currentScript:void 0,280485,e=>{"use strict";var a=e.i(833124),t=e.i(100157),i=e.i(685149);let r=`${i.LEONARDO_AI_CDN_STATIC_IMAGES_URL}/generations-page`,o=`${i.LEONARDO_AI_CDN_STATIC_VIDEOS_URL}/generation`,n=`${i.LEONARDO_AI_CDN_STATIC_IMAGES_URL}/lightning-stream`,s=[{prompt:'A flat lay product shot of an organic coffee brand called "Raíz", a kraft paper bag with a hand-drawn botanical illustration of a coffee plant in warm terracotta and forest green ink, a small circular stamp logo featuring a decorative initial letter of the brand name above the word "Raíz" in a clean serif font, scattered whole coffee beans and dried leaves around the bag on a rough linen surface, soft natural window light from the left, photorealistic product photography style, warm muted tones.',promptId:"logo_product_coffee_bag",imageUrl:`${r}/logo_product_coffee_bag.webp`},{prompt:"A cinematic close-up of a female model with bleached blonde cropped hair and bold graphic eyeliner, wearing a simple white fitted top, holding a sleek minimalist glass serum bottle at chest height, soft studio light from the side, clean neutral background, beauty editorial style, shot on medium format, subtle shadows, refined and precise.",promptId:"marketing_beauty_serum",imageUrl:`${r}/marketing_beauty_serum.webp`},{prompt:"An oil painting portrait of a weathered British Royal Navy captain from the 1800s with deep set eyes and a thick grey beard, ornate dark navy double breasted coat with heavy gold epaulettes and polished brass buttons, a bicorn hat with gold trim, intense direct gaze, deep wrinkles and sun weathered skin, warm dramatic side light from the left, loose expressive brushwork, rich deep tones of navy and gold, dark softly blurred background, painterly and brush stroke textured, close-up medium shot.",promptId:"portrait_navy_captain",imageUrl:`${r}/portrait_navy_captain_1.webp`},{prompt:"A beautiful full shot of an optimistic cute & fluffy black cat with a white chest patch and bright green eyes looking towards the camera, with a small friendly bird perched on top of the cat's head, both unaware of the irony. Warm midday sunlight streaming in from the window, soft curtains to the side, lush green garden visible outside. Modern, professional, clean and mainstream 3D movie production animation style, side angle shot with, intense golden hour lighting  that creates a golden linging around the cat's fur, creating a light sillouette. The eyes of the characters are perfectly shaped, comforting and inspirational.",promptId:"cat_bird_window",imageUrl:`${r}/cat_bird_window_2.webp`},{prompt:"A cinematic photo of a Bengal tiger's face partially emerging through oversized lotus leaves and flowers, rich orange and white fur with sharp black stripes, intense amber eyes gazing directly at the viewer, large lush green lotus leaves filling the entire frame, soft diffused natural light filtering through the foliage, shallow depth of field with leaves softly blurred in the foreground, close-up composition with the tiger centered and partially obscured by foliage, photorealistic, deep rich greens and warm orange tones.",promptId:"portrait_tiger_leaves",imageUrl:`${r}/portrait_tiger_leaves.webp`},{prompt:"A cinematic film photograph of a close-up portrait of a female model with a single piercing blue-green eye visible, freckled skin and natural brows, her face partially obscured by a cluster of blooming cosmos flowers in soft peach and pink, small white flowers and cream buttercups scattered throughout, shallow depth of field with flowers softly blurred in the foreground and background, soft diffused natural light, warm muted tones of peach and cream, visible film grain, intimate and delicate mood.",promptId:"portrait_woman_flowers",imageUrl:`${r}/portrait_woman_flowers_2.webp`},{prompt:"A side profie view of a vintage red compact beetle car parked in the middle of a vast field of bright yellow rapeseed flowers in full bloom, the flowers reaching up to the car's windows, car shown in full side profile, clear bright blue sky with no clouds, strong midday sunlight, wide shot with the car centered in the frame, photorealistic, vivid saturated colours of red yellow and blue, clean and minimal composition.",promptId:"landscape_red_car",imageUrl:`${r}/landscape_red_car.webp`},{prompt:"A wildlife photography shot of a chestnut brown shire horse with a rich reddish brown coat and thick white feathered legs standing at the edge of a shallow rocky stream with its head lowered drinking water, soft morning fog drifting low across the valley floor partially obscuring the horse's legs, tall dark green pine trees fading into the hazy mist on the slopes behind, dramatic low hanging clouds and thick fog rolling through the mountain peaks above. Cool diffused early morning light filtering through the mist. Wide shot showing the full valley with the horse small in the lower foreground shot from a distance with a telephoto lens. Moody and atmospheric wilderness mood, muted cool greens and grey tones throughout.",promptId:"chestnut_brown_horse",imageUrl:`${r}/chestnut_brown_horse.webp`},{prompt:"A cinematic photo of a small blue wooden rowing boat with a white trim and brown interior anchored alone in a calm shallow estuary, pink and lavender dusk sky reflecting on the still water surface, lush green marsh grass and reeds lining the banks, dense dark green tree line along the horizon, soft fading twilight light, wide shot with the boat centered in the lower foreground, perfectly still water with a subtle reflection of the boat below, tranquil and peaceful mood, rich saturated tones of pink blue and green.",promptId:"landscape_boat_calm",imageUrl:`${r}/landscape_boat_calm.webp`},{prompt:"Premium wellness supplement packaging for performance greens - single box with embossed botanical textures on matte olive green paper stock with leaf patterns. Clean minimalist design. Surrounded by fresh natural ingredients - spirulina powder, wheatgrass, matcha green tea powder, fresh kale leaves, spinach. Soft directional studio lighting creating gentle shadows on a warm taupe gradient background. Professional product photography style, sophisticated earth-tone color palette, tactile textured surfaces, premium packaging design aesthetic.",promptId:"wellness supplement packaging",imageUrl:`${r}/wellness_supplement_packaging.webp`},{prompt:"A hyper-detailed, high-contrast studio photograph of woman with deep, blue-black skin and an intense direct gaze. Her one eye features a striking, vivid neon-orange eyeshadow and a similar orange image art glitch on her forehead. The composition is a close-up editorial photo, set against a flat, soft pink background. The entire image is aggressively disrupted by a vibrant digital glitch-colour bleeding effect, datamoshing, and pixel sorting. Digital-smudged, linear streaks of rainbow colors (cyan, magenta, electric blue, orange, green) bleed horizontally and vertically, tearing across her face, astracting some of the portrait away behind the colours and the background, hiding parts of the portrait as if its a portal. The lighting is pofessional, textures detailed and abstract editorial - post editing done in photostop professionally. Deep shadows and neon accents. Afrofuturism meets Vaporwave, high fashion, chromatic aberration.",promptId:"woman_with_neon_eyeshadow",imageUrl:`${r}/woman_with_neon_eyeshadow.webp`},{prompt:"A detailed editorial shot of a seasoned adult female traveler in a highly polished modern anime art style. Close-up of a character with vibrant, short, split-dye hair blowing in the wind, and a joyful smile, wearing interesting and uniquely-random clothing, rugged. The background is a zoomed out panoramic view of a space-age city, with large, bleeding color fields, light that spill and create textured, glitchy & cinematic lighting. The world is a dystopian space age timeline. Deep modern anime style lightning",promptId:"seasoned_female_traveler_anime",imageUrl:`${r}/seasoned_female_traveler_anime.webp`},{prompt:"Editorial shot of a female character posing for a photoshoot, intense but upbeat, mordern and fashionable. Platinum blonde hair loosely twisted into a messy top bun with wispy bangs framing her face, wearing an oversized powder blue button up shirt, sitting amongst a lush arrangement of contrasting lilies, small flowes and green foliage, direct relaxed gaze into the camera, bold deep background with cinematic lighting reaching through a window, medium shot showing full upper body. Modern photography and professional camera work",promptId:"female_character_posing_for_photoshoot",imageUrl:`${r}/female_character_posing_for_photoshoot.webp`},{prompt:"A fashion editorial photo of a male model with a short bright orange Caesar cut, shot from the side, wearing a mustard yellow knit sweater, a delicate silver tennis necklace with a gold dog tag on the neck, frosted white angular sunglasses with gold trim visible from the side, soft gradient background from pale blue at the top to warm white at the bottom, diffused studio light from above, close-up medium shot framed from the shoulders up, clean and minimal, high fashion editorial style.",promptId:"male_model_with_orange_caesar_cut",imageUrl:`${r}/male_model_with_orange_caesar_cut.webp`}],l=[{prompt:"A slow timelapse video of a single white poppy flower blooming gracefully , starting from a tight closed bud and gradually opening petal by petal to a full bloom, revealing the delicate gold and green centre. Camera starts in an extreme close-up on the bud and slowly zooms out as the flower blooms to reveal the full flower on a thin green stem. Soft diffused studio light from above. Clean blue linear gradient background lighter at the top fading to dark blue at the bottom. Slow and graceful motion throughout.",promptId:"poppy_flower_blooming",imageUrl:`${r}/poppy_flower_blooming_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/poppy_flower_blooming.mp4`},{prompt:"A first person POV shot of riding a brown horse galloping through a vast golden green meadow, the horse's flowing dark brown mane and rope reins visible in the lower foreground, tall grass blurring on both sides from the speed. Pine trees lining the hillsides, a winding river valley and dramatic mountain range in the distance. Warm golden sunset light flooding the horizon. Dramatic wide open sky with scattered white clouds above. Camera bobs naturally with the rhythm of the galloping horse. Vibrant and cinematic mood.",promptId:"brown_horse_galloping",imageUrl:`${r}/brown_horse_galloping_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/brown_horse_galloping.mp4`},{prompt:"A female model with blonde wet hair, blue eyes and light freckle floating serenely in a shallow koi pond, face just above the water surface surrounded by large green lily pads, small orange koi fish swimming slowly around her. She wears a flowy white dress. Her eyes are closed at the start, then slowly and gently open as she gazes directly up into the camera. Soft rippling water light patterns reflecting across her face. Camera locked off in a direct overhead bird's eye shot. Soft diffused natural light from above. Calm and ethereal mood.",promptId:"female_model_floating",imageUrl:`${r}/female_model_floating_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/female_model_floating.mp4`},{prompt:"An East Asian male with short curly dark hair standing in a vast open green grass field, wearing an oversized olive green shirt and dark trousers, arms stretched out wide to both sides, head tilted back with eyes closed, large silver headphones over his ears. A gentle wind slowly moves through the tall grass around him. Overcast grey sky above. Soft diffused natural light. Peaceful and cinematic mood.",promptId:"standing_in_green_grass_field",imageUrl:`${r}/standing_in_green_grass_field_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/standing_in_green_grass_field.mp4`},{prompt:'Wide shot of a white vintage sports car with a  number plate that says "CR3ATE" driving fast through a flat open grassland at sunset. Camera tracks alongside behind the car in a three-quarter back view follow shot, keeping pace with the vehicle. Warm golden orange light at the horizon fading to a rich teal sky above with a few pink clouds. Tall grass lining both sides of the road. Steady camera movement passing through the tall grass matching the car\'s pace. Cinematic, warm and nostalgic mood.',promptId:"vintage_car_driving",imageUrl:`${r}/vintage_car_driving_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/vintage_car_driving.mp4`},{prompt:"A medium shot in a stylized 2D anime aesthetic, interior of a train, focusing on a young woman seated in front of a train window quietly reading a book. She has short dark hair and wears a simple light coloured top. Behind her the train window shows a blurred cityscape passing by, buildings and lights moving horizontally at different speeds creating a parallax effect, with some buildings drifting slower and others faster giving a sense of depth and distance. A mix of modern high rise buildings and glowing lights at dusk. Soft diffused lighting with a subtle colour palette of blues and oranges visible through the window. Camera static positioned at a slight angle capturing her profile and the scenery outside. Calm and contemplative mood.",promptId:"woman_reading_on_train_anime",imageUrl:`${r}/woman_reading_on_train_anime_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/woman_reading_on_train_anime.mp4`,videoPosition:"right"},{prompt:"A modern advert of a perfume bottle placed on a rotating pedistal, realistic and professional. The scene is decorated in a way that would support a professional photograhy studio shot in editorial lightining. The perfume has a modern look and label, with light changing slightly throughout the scene in a elegant way. ",promptId:"perfume_bottle_rotating_pedistal",imageUrl:`${r}/perfume_bottle_rotating_pedistal_cover_image.webp`,videoUrl:`${o}/perfume_bottle_rotating_pedistal.mp4`}],d=[{prompt:"Editorial fashion photo, slim male model in edgy streetwear: parka, shirt, pants with 1890s American Western detailing. Side-swept hair, asymmetrical anti-fashion design with frills. Plain linear gradient backdrop.",promptId:"editorial_fashion_shoot",imageUrl:`${n}/editorial_fashion_shoot.webp`},{prompt:"Abstract artistic photo, extreme closeup of a flower distorted by diffraction and refraction. Soft peach and pink petals, green center. Bright gradient background, dynamic composition.",promptId:"flower_abstract_artistic_photograph",imageUrl:`${n}/flower_abstract_artistic_photograph.webp`},{prompt:"Surreal analog photo, cinematic lighting, minimalist pale landscape. Colossal vivid fabric sculpture rippling in the sky, small solitary figure in dark clothing seen from behind in mid-foreground.",promptId:"surreal_analog_visual",imageUrl:`${n}/surreal_analog_visual.webp`},{prompt:"3D C4D style, minimalist composition. Tilted basalt rock fragment with delicate flowers, coral formations, and soft moss floating in air. Linear gradient backdrop, centered.",promptId:"3d_visual_style_rock_fragment",imageUrl:`${n}/3d_visual_style_rock_fragment.webp`},{prompt:"90s anime cel-shaded screencap, medium closeup of male character, confident expression with subtle smile, stylized features. Harajuku kitsch outfit: vibrant puffy jacket with patches, turtleneck. Painterly daytime sky background.",promptId:"90s_anime_celshaded_screencap",imageUrl:`${n}/90s_anime_celshaded_screencap.webp`},{prompt:"Documentary photo, high angle epic landscape, rugged and vibrant, atmospheric textures, cloud shadows, green hues, dramatic sunlight. Monolithic concentric circles of rock pillars in center.",promptId:"documentary_photograph",imageUrl:`${n}/documentary_photograph.webp`},{prompt:"Editorial fashion photo, hyperrealistic androgynous model, glossy skin, glowing hair, crystalline outfit. Edgy magazine style, analog film grain, blue hour background.",promptId:"editorial_fashion_photography",imageUrl:`${n}/editorial_fashion_photography.webp`},{prompt:"Architectural photo, sculptural modernist townhouse, rough-hewn detailing, offset blocky shapes, concrete and rough limestone, reflective pools, colored accents.",promptId:"townhouse_architectural_photo",imageUrl:`${n}/townhouse_architectural_photo.webp`},{prompt:"Architectural detail shot, sculptural modernist public building, wooden bamboo slat facade, futurist minimal design, dynamic angle, sky backdrop.",promptId:"public_building_architectural_detail_shot",imageUrl:`${n}/public_building_architectural_detail_shot.webp`},{prompt:"Japanese modernist interior, brutalist elements, wood and concrete, slat panels, bonsai, low table, chairs, alcove.",promptId:"japanese_inspired_modernist_interior",imageUrl:`${n}/japanese_inspired_modernist_interior.webp`},{prompt:"Minimalist 3D graphic design, abstract shapes, varied textures, playful design, bright colors, minimalist background.",promptId:"minimalist_3d_graphic_design_visual",imageUrl:`${n}/minimalist_3d_graphic_design_visual.webp`},{prompt:"Painterly digital illustration, open Midwest landscape, hillside prairie house, minimalist leading composition.",promptId:"painterly_background_illustration",imageUrl:`${n}/painterly_background_illustration.webp`},{prompt:"Flat retro vector illustration, art deco style, sleek minimalist shapes, textured gradient shading, poster of a car.",promptId:"flat_retro_vector_illustration",imageUrl:`${n}/flat_retro_vector_illustration.webp`},{prompt:"Cinematic still, medium shot of lone male figure in racing outfit seen from behind, standing before an F1 car in a garage, confident relaxed pose, minimalist composition.",promptId:"cinematic_male_figure_in_racing_outfit",imageUrl:`${n}/cinematic_male_figure_in_racing_outfit.webp`},{prompt:"3D sculpt, soft stylized jellyfish, vibrant glowing gradient shading, exaggerated proportions, simple light backdrop.",promptId:"3d_jellyfish_sculpt",imageUrl:`${n}/3d_jellyfish_sculp